{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reloader: subject_alpha</strong> is an experimental &quot;Bullet Counting Reload Action&quot; game that features realistic gun control combined with movie-style cinematics. We were inspired by numerous classic shootouts from movies and the indie game called Receiver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience being a Reloader: having legendary shooting skills and engaging in Close-Quarters Combat(CQC). You just have to remember how to use the gun you\u2019re holding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually control every step of reloading, such as loading the mag and cocking the slide to chamber a round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/861b5b05a6a937654d77714273189e4b.poster.avif?t=1768564853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/861b5b05a6a937654d77714273189e4b.webm?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/861b5b05a6a937654d77714273189e4b.mp4?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your faulty gun will keep you busy when it unexpectedly fails. Do what is necessary to get your gun functioning again, calmly and quickly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/786f290c49658d249fadbbec1ed45b8e.poster.avif?t=1768564853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/786f290c49658d249fadbbec1ed45b8e.webm?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/786f290c49658d249fadbbec1ed45b8e.mp4?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are responsible for knowing how many bullets are left in your magazine. Keep count and get ready to reload at the right time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/a8ef0b2a94280da1260484b1b60d4cdf.poster.avif?t=1768564853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/a8ef0b2a94280da1260484b1b60d4cdf.webm?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/a8ef0b2a94280da1260484b1b60d4cdf.mp4?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tactical combat based on realistic situations that require problem solving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/dacbffd8cb4e4577ffc9440c04b4b4ef.poster.avif?t=1768564853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/dacbffd8cb4e4577ffc9440c04b4b4ef.webm?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/dacbffd8cb4e4577ffc9440c04b4b4ef.mp4?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the unique art style combination of retro pixel graphics and futuristic lighting effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/65a07f9852ba1231831ef9aed95ab03d.poster.avif?t=1768564853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/65a07f9852ba1231831ef9aed95ab03d.webm?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/65a07f9852ba1231831ef9aed95ab03d.mp4?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were a legendary agent who fell into a coma after an unexpected accident. Fortunately, you regained consciousness due to the efforts of the doctors. In the process, the trauma left you without most of your memories. All that is left are your shooting and aiming skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are still many tasks left that only a legendary agent can solve. Reclaim your memory and skills by completing countless missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/f8ce50c44dce8b4dd3c0f1b1f94a9b6d.poster.avif?t=1768564853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/f8ce50c44dce8b4dd3c0f1b1f94a9b6d.webm?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/f8ce50c44dce8b4dd3c0f1b1f94a9b6d.mp4?t=1768564853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1830160?t=1768564853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768564853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/09db81bf4f0175a6a9ffb1ae590cef126ff1db1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768564853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/09db81bf4f0175a6a9ffb1ae590cef126ff1db1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768564853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood\r\nIntense Violence\r\nStrong Language"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reloader: subject_alpha</strong> is an experimental &quot;Bullet Counting Reload Action&quot; game that features realistic gun control combined with movie-style cinematics. We were inspired by numerous classic shootouts from movies and the indie game called Receiver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience being a Reloader: having legendary shooting skills and engaging in Close-Quarters Combat(CQC). You just have to remember how to use the gun you\u2019re holding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually control every step of reloading, such as loading the mag and cocking the slide to chamber a round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830160/extras/861b5b05a6a937654d77714273189e4b.poster.avif?t=1768564853\" width=640 height=360 ><source sr